# qflix-torrent-janitor exclusions — qBit torrent hashes to protect from the
# completed-untracked-seeding reap. One 40-char hash per line (case-insensitive).
# '#' comments and blank lines ignored.
#
# Use this ONLY for a torrent you deliberately want to keep seeding forever
# (e.g. helping a private-tracker ratio, or a rare release worth keeping alive).
# Everything else that is complete + *arr-untracked + past its ratio/age is fair
# game — "nothing forever" is the design.
#
# (currently no active rules — same as the reaper's exclude)
